        "container": null,
        "content": [
          {
            "citations": null,
            "text": "# Two Key Aspects of Democracy\n\n1. **Popular Sovereignty / Rule by the People**\n   - Citizens have the ultimate authority in government through voting and participation\n   - Political power derives from the consent of the governed\n\n2. **Protection of Individual Rights and Freedoms**\n   - Guaranteed civil liberties such as freedom of speech, assembly, and religion\n   - Equal protection under the law and safeguards against tyranny of the majority\n\nThese two elements work together: the people govern themselves while respecting fundamental rights that cannot be violated even by majority rule.",
            "type": "text"
          }
